---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../../../components/PageHeader.astro';
import StatusBadge from '../../../components/StatusBadge.astro';
import { url } from '../../../utils/url';
import prismShot from '../../../assets/captures/launcher-prism.png';
---
<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  translated
  title="PRISM — Perceptual rendering"
  description="PRISM (Perceptual Rendering & Interactive Simulation Module) makes the simulated world visible: Unreal project and PRISM-LDK integration plugin. Out of scope for V0.1."
>
  <PageHeader
    lang="en"
    index="08"
    eyebrow="Architecture · PRISM"
    title="Rendering."
    lead="PRISM (Perceptual Rendering & Interactive Simulation Module) gives form and presence to the simulated world. It is the least advanced component of the project, and we say so."
    crumbs={[{ label: 'Architecture', href: 'technique/' }, { label: 'PRISM' }]}
  />

  <section class="block">
    <div class="w">
      <p style="margin-top:0"><StatusBadge status="developpement" lang="en" /> <span class="mu">Unreal project and PRISM-LDK plugin</span></p>
      <div class="cc"><p>In development: the PRISM rendering experience is <strong>out of scope for V0.1</strong>. No playable version is claimed.</p></div>

      <div class="sh"><b>8.1</b> Role</div>
      <h2>Making dynamics visible.</h2>
      <p>
        Where SYNE computes and ECHOS measures, PRISM <strong>makes things perceptible</strong>: it transforms the world state
        and its events into an observable and interactive scene. It consists of an Unreal project and an integration
        plugin, <strong>PRISM-LDK</strong>.
      </p>

      <figure class="shot">
        <img src={prismShot.src} alt="PRISM rendering preview" width={prismShot.width} height={prismShot.height} loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption>Capture — PRISM rendering preview (work-in-progress).</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <div class="w">
      <div class="sh"><b>8.2</b> State</div>
      <h2>The youngest component.</h2>
      <p>
        PRISM is a work-in-progress. No timeline is promised. The project's roadmap is authoritative, and rendering
        is not listed for V0.1.
      </p>
      <div class="cc">
        <p>Do not assume that local protections in the engine or mock secure distribution of the PRISM project. See <a href="https://github.com/donovan-dev-web/LIVEX/blob/main/SECURITY.md" rel="noopener">SECURITY.md</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top:18px"><a class="bt" href={url('technique/', 'en')}>← Overview</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>